@host = http://localhost:4004

### 1. Check current Person state (baseline from seed CSV)
GET {{host}}/dashboard/Persons

### 2. Trigger J4C user sync
POST {{host}}/admin/syncJ4CUsers
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 3. Check Person state after sync
# Expect: Alice Chen created, Bin Jiang refreshed, Robert Maloney active:false (not deleted)
GET {{host}}/dashboard/Persons

### 4. Run sync again - should be idempotent
# Expect: created:0, reactivated:0, refreshed:2, deactivated:0
POST {{host}}/admin/syncJ4CUsers
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 5. Check Person state after second sync (only lastSeenAt should move)
GET {{host}}/dashboard/Persons

### 6. Check Initiatives too, once enabledUsers is wired up
GET {{host}}/dashboard/Initiatives